Grixis Reanimator combo: mulligan aggressively toward a hand that can DISCARD a huge creature (Griselbrand, Atraxa Grand Unifier, Archon of Cruelty) via Faithless Looting / Cabal Therapy / Unmask, then REANIMATE it turn 1-2 with Reanimate / Animate Dead / Shallow Grave (Dark Ritual + Lotus Petal for speed). Griselbrand's draw-7 refuels and protects. Strip disruption with Thoughtseize/Cabal Therapy. Win fast before they set up.
